  "abstract": "Pivoting to a new research direction, this submission tests the hypothesis that the SOTA's simple linear encoder is a performance bottleneck. This experiment augments the SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 369) with a new Temporal CNN Encoder. A small 1D CNN first processes the 4-step input sequence to extract temporal features. These features, rather than the raw input, are then fed into the standard factorized linear projection. This tests if a richer, pre-processed input to the latent space improves downstream forecasting.",
